    "“%@ on %@” and its downloads are removed from this device." : {
      "comment" : "First %@ is the username, second is the server host.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "“%1$@ on %2$@” and its downloads are removed from this device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@ 在 %2$@ 上的账户”及其下载内容将从此设备中移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” has different progress here than on the server — this device is at %@, the server is at %@. Which one should win?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "“%1$@” has different progress here than on the server — this device is at %2$@, the server is at %3$@. Which one should win?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@” 在本设备上的进度与服务器不一致：本设备为 %2$@，服务器为 %3$@。要以哪一个为准？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” stops and Up Next is cleared. Your place in it is saved." : {
      "comment" : "Server switch confirmation body; %@ is the title of the loaded book",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@”将停止播放，待播列表会被清空。你在其中的位置已保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” will be deleted from this device. Your progress is kept." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation message. %@ is the book title",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@”将从此设备中删除。你的进度会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Previously On…\" and \"I Zoned Out\" in the player's menu use Apple Intelligence to write short recaps from the transcript. It all happens on this iPhone." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "播放器菜单中的“前情回顾…”和“我走神了”会使用 Apple 智能根据转写文本撰写简短回顾。这一切都在这台 iPhone 上完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Previously On…\" and \"I Zoned Out\" in the player’s menu use Apple Intelligence to write short recaps from the transcript. It all happens on this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "播放器菜单中的“前情回顾…”和“我走神了”会使用 Apple 智能根据转写文本撰写简短回顾。这一切都在这台 iPhone 上完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Reload” re-reads this account’s download index (use it if downloads look out of sync after switching accounts). “Remove all” deletes only the current account’s downloaded files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“重新加载”会重新读取此账户的下载索引（切换账户后如果下载内容显示不同步，可以使用它）。“全部移除”只会删除当前账户已下载的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Reset sleep timer” restarts the countdown. “Extend +15 min” adds time to a running timer. “Off” turns the gesture off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“重置睡眠定时器”会重新开始倒计时。“延长 +15 分钟”会为正在运行的定时器增加时间。“关闭”会关闭此手势。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
