    "%@ · %@" : {
      "comment" : "A bookmark moment. First %@ is the time within the chapter, second the chapter title\nCollection/playlist header; first %@ is a count phrase like '6 books', second %@ is the total duration like '42h 10m'\nDuration and file size separated by a dot; %1$@ is a duration, %2$@ a size\nLibrary count line; first %@ is the count phrase, second %@ is the sort description\nPrimary button label: %1$@ is a verb (Pause or Resume), %2$@ is a chapter title or time-left text\nProgress summary: %1$@ is a percentage like 42%, %2$@ is time left text",
