    },
    "Each deck redraws the player's artwork and keys. From the Cover takes its colours from the book that's playing. Button sounds are short clicks when you press a player key. They follow the volume, and, as with other playback audio, play even when the Silent switch is on, so they are off by default." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "每种播放机外观都会重绘播放器的插图和按键。“取自封面”的颜色取自正在播放的书。按键声音是按下播放器按键时的短促咔嗒声。它们跟随音量，并且与其他播放音频一样，即使打开静音开关也会播放，因此默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each deck redraws the player’s artwork and keys. From the Cover takes its colours from the book that’s playing. Button sounds are short clicks when you press a player key. They follow the volume, and, as with other playback audio, play even when the Silent switch is on, so they are off by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "每种播放机外观都会重绘播放器的插图和按键。“取自封面”的颜色取自正在播放的书。按键声音是按下播放器按键时的短促咔嗒声。它们跟随音量，并且与其他播放音频一样，即使打开静音开关也会播放，因此默认关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each tip can appear again when its moment comes around. One already shown this launch may need a relaunch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "每条技巧会在合适的时机再次出现。本次启动中已显示过的技巧可能需要重新启动后才会再次出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
