    },
    "Exports server addresses and usernames only — never passwords or custom HTTP headers. Importing prefills the Add Server form; you'll still need to enter that account's password, and re-add any reverse-proxy header by hand if that server needs one. Export/Import Settings carries your app preferences (playback, downloads, appearance, favourites) the same way, also without any credentials." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "只会导出服务器地址和用户名，绝不包含密码或自定义 HTTP 标头。导入时会预填“添加服务器”表单；你仍需输入该账户的密码，如果该服务器需要反向代理标头，也需要手动重新添加。“导出/导入设置”会以同样方式带上你的 App 偏好设置（播放、下载、外观、收藏），同样不包含任何凭据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exports server addresses and usernames only — never passwords or custom HTTP headers. Importing prefills the Add Server form; you’ll still need to enter that account’s password, and re-add any reverse-proxy header by hand if that server needs one. Export/Import Settings carries your app preferences (playback, downloads, appearance, favourites) the same way, also without any credentials." : {
