    "For a server behind a proxy that needs its own header — most people can leave this empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "适用于位于代理之后、需要专属标头的服务器——大多数人可以留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a server behind a reverse proxy that needs its own header to let requests through — e.g. Cloudflare Access or Authelia. Most people can leave this empty." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "适用于位于反向代理之后、需要专属标头才能放行请求的服务器，例如 Cloudflare Access 或 Authelia。大多数人可以留空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a server with OpenID Connect / Single Sign-On configured (Settings → Authentication on the server). Tap this instead of filling in username and password — Audiobookshelf runs the whole exchange with your identity provider." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "适用于已配置 OpenID Connect / 单点登录的服务器（服务器上的“设置”→“身份验证”）。请轻点此项，而不是填写用户名和密码——Audiobookshelf 会与你的身份提供方完成整个验证流程。"
          }
        }
