    "If a timer like “30 min” would end within a few minutes of a chapter break, it stops at the break instead of mid-sentence." : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in a tooltip for the \"Smart sleep timer\" setting.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果类似“30 分钟”的定时器会在章节分界点前后几分钟内结束，它会在分界点处停止，而不是在句子中间停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it sits behind a reverse proxy, check that Audiobookshelf itself is running." : {
      "comment" : "Next step to take if the server returned an error code that isn't handled by the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果它位于反向代理之后，请检查 Audiobookshelf 本身是否正在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it sits behind Cloudflare Access, Authelia, or a similar gate, add its headers under Advanced below and test again." : {
      "comment" : "Next step to take if a server returns a 401 or 403 status code.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果它位于 Cloudflare Access、Authelia 或类似的验证网关之后，请在下方“高级”中添加其标头，然后重新测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If it uses a self-signed certificate, iOS won’t trust it. Check the port number, and that Audiobookshelf is running." : {
      "comment" : "Next step to take if a server doesn't use https, and the user has not tried plain http.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果它使用自签名证书，iOS 不会信任它。请检查端口号，并确认 Audiobookshelf 正在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If its certificate changed or expired, iOS won’t trust it until that’s fixed on the server." : {
      "comment" : "A message that explains why a server's certificate isn't trusted.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果它的证书已更改或已过期，在服务器上修复之前，iOS 不会信任它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If your server sits behind Cloudflare Access, Authelia, or a similar gate, add its headers under Advanced below and test again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "如果你的服务器位于 Cloudflare Access、Authelia 或类似的验证网关之后，请在下方“高级”中添加其标头，然后重新测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import & Export" : {
      "localizations" : {
