    "Jumps forward this many seconds when a chapter starts, and moves on to the next chapter this many seconds before one ends. When either is set it replaces title matching for every book. Choosing a chapter, scrubbing or using next and previous chapter never triggers it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "章节开始时向前跳过设定的秒数，并在章节结束前相同的秒数处进入下一章。只要设置了其中任意一项，就会对所有书籍取代按标题匹配的方式。选择章节、拖动进度条或使用上一章、下一章时不会触发。"
