    },
    "Number in %@" : {
      "comment" : "A label that asks the user to enter the number of a book in a series. The argument is the name of the series.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "在《%@》中的编号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "Chapter skip option: disabled\nDaily goal is switched off\nDiagnostics value for a disabled setting.\nListening profile name: no profile active\nShake action: do nothing\nSleep timer option: no timer\nSleep timer option: timer disabled\nVoiceOver value of the sleep timer button when no timer is set",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default: your auth token goes in a request header, never in the URL — safer if your server or a reverse proxy logs full request URLs. Turn this on only if playback stalls or fails partway through a book on your setup — some proxy/AVPlayer combinations drop the header on the range requests AVPlayer makes mid-stream, and adding the token to the URL as well works around that." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "默认关闭：你的身份验证令牌会放在请求标头中，绝不会出现在 URL 里——如果你的服务器或反向代理会记录完整的请求 URL，这样更安全。仅当播放在你的环境中中途卡顿或失败时才打开此选项——某些代理与 AVPlayer 的组合会在 AVPlayer 播放中途发出的范围请求中丢失标头，同时把令牌加到 URL 中即可规避这个问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline" : {
      "comment" : "Text displayed in a notification when a book can't be played.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
